<main id="content" class="site-main post-19071 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-uncategorized">

			<div class="page-header">
			<h1 class="entry-title">Bliv medlem</h1>		</div>
	
	<div class="page-content">
				<div data-elementor-type="wp-post" data-elementor-id="19071" class="elementor elementor-19071" data-elementor-post-type="post">
						<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d0feb39 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="d0feb39" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-66 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-52c69c5" data-id="52c69c5" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f077914 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="f077914" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Det Jødiske Samfund rummer jøder med mange forskellige holdninger og måder at leve på.</p><p>Du kan blive medlem, hvis du er født af en jødisk mor eller er konverteret ortodokst. <span style="font-size: 1rem;">Overrabbiner Jair Melchior skal godkende din indmeldelse.</span></p><p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://djs.dk/medlem/">Læs mere og find indmeldelsesformularer her.</a></span></p><hr /><div><div data-test-render-count="1"><div><div><div data-is-streaming="false"><div><div><div><p>The Jewish Community includes Jews with many different views and ways of life. <span style="font-size: 1rem;">You can become a member if you were born of a Jewish mother or have converted orthodoxly. Chief Rabbi Jair Melchior must approve your application. </span></p><p><a style="background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 1rem;" href="https://djs.dk/medlem/">Read more and find membership forms here.</a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div data-test-render-count="1"><div style="height: auto; opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div style="opacity: 1; transform: none;" data-is-streaming="false"><hr /><div style="text-align: right;" aria-hidden="true"> <span style="font-size: 1rem;">הקהילה היהודית כוללת יהודים עם השקפות ודרכי חיים שונות ומגוונות. תוכל להפוך לחבר אם נולדת לאם יהודייה או התגיירת בגיור אורתודוקסי. הרב הראשי יאיר מלכיאור חייב לאשר את בקשת ההצטרפות שלך.</span></div><div style="text-align: right;" aria-hidden="true"><span style="font-size: 1rem;"> </span></div><div style="text-align: right;"><div data-test-render-count="1"><div style="height: auto; opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div><div style="opacity: 1; transform: none;" data-is-streaming="false"><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><p><a href="https://djs.dk/wp-content/uploads/djs-memnership-heb-2026-2.pdf"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">קרא עוד ומצא טפסי הצטרפות כאן.</span></a></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div><div> </div></div></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align: right;"><span style="font-size: 1rem;"> </span></p><p style="text-align: right;"><span style="font-size: 1rem;"> </span></p><p style="text-align: right;"><span style="font-size: 1rem;"> </span></p></div></div></div></div>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
				<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7a63a06" data-id="7a63a06" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
